  "title": "First Advantage Wins Gold for Excellence in Internal Communications in the 2025 Merit Awards for Marketing & Communications",
  "summary": "First Advantage (FA) has been honored in the 2025 Merit Awards for Marketing & Communications, receiving the gold award in the Internal Communications category, recognizing the company’s outstanding internal communications strategy during the acquisition of Sterling. The award highlights the “Day One” internal communication plan, which was designed to provide team members with clear, transparent, … Continued",
